docs {
  ## API explanation
  One active package, same shape as an entry in the **packages** list. An
  inactive package returns 404 -- the public API never exposes one.

  `teacher_count` is how many teachers it can be booked with;
  `GET /public/packages/<id>/teachers/` lists them with their slots.

  ## API example response
  {
    "id": "347cde65-90ad-4178-8816-332e19e04748",
    "image_url": "",
    "total_classes": 10,
    "validity_days": 90,
    "price": "135.00",
    "is_first_lesson": false,
    "sort_order": 2,
    "teacher_count": 4,
    "title": "10-Class Package",
    "description": "10 x 60-minute private lessons. Valid for 3 months.",
    "lang": "en"
  }
}
